OL,3,GNEWSAGroup's plan to fix community hub
OL,4,Ain 'sorry state'
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers have pledged to try to
OL,7,Frevive a community centre in Leeds
OL,8,Fwhich they say is "underused" and in a
OL,9,Fsorry state of disrepair.
OL,11,FThe Garden Village Welfare Association
OL,12,F(GVWA) Community Centre in Cross Gates
OL,13,Fwas once a bustling hive of activity
OL,14,Ffor local groups, with regular theatre
OL,15,Fproductions and exercise classes among
OL,16,Fits many uses.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
