OL,3,GNEWSAGroup's plan to fix community hub
OL,4,Ain 'sorry state'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the building is now only used a few
OL,7,Fhours a week and is in dire need of
OL,8,Frenovation so, on Saturday, an event
OL,9,Fwill be held to draw attention to its
OL,10,Fplight, with a fire-eating juggler
OL,11,Famong the entertainment.
OL,13,FOne of the volunteers, Helen Lucy, said
OL,14,Fthey would "love it" if the centre
OL,15,Fbecame a place where people could
OL,16,Fregularly get together as a community.
